---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: hub
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <h1>Every mineral, crystal &amp; gem<br><span>in one place.</span></h1>
    <p>Crystopedia covers all {{ site.stats.species | number }} IMA-recognised mineral species plus popular varieties and gemstones – chemistry, crystal systems, hardness, density and more, with traditional crystal lore for {{ site.stats.healing }} favourite stones.</p>
    <form class="hero-search" action="/search/" method="get">
      <input type="search" name="q" placeholder="Search e.g. quartz, emerald, cubic…" aria-label="Search minerals">
      <button type="submit">Search</button>
    </form>
    <p class="hero-id"><a href="/identify/">Found a stone and don't know what it is? Try the Crystal Identifier →</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-gem" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200"><defs><linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#c4b5fd"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6d28d9"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="g2" x1="1" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#a5f3fc"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4f46e5"/></linearGradient></defs>
    <polygon points="100,10 160,60 100,190" fill="url(#g1)"/><polygon points="100,10 40,60 100,190" fill="url(#g2)"/><polygon points="40,60 100,10 160,60 100,75" fill="#ede9fe" opacity=".85"/><polygon points="40,60 100,75 100,190" fill="#7c3aed" opacity=".55"/><polygon points="160,60 100,75 100,190" fill="#22d3ee" opacity=".35"/></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats">
  <div><strong>{{ site.stats.total | number }}</strong><span>pages</span></div>
  <div><strong>{{ site.stats.species | number }}</strong><span>mineral species</span></div>
  <div><strong>{{ site.stats.varieties | number }}</strong><span>varieties</span></div>
  <div><strong>{{ site.stats.withImage | number }}</strong><span>with photos</span></div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Popular crystals</h2>
  <div class="grid">{% for c in site.popular %}{% include "card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
</section>

